{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvaffTmFT2pwR3psDgzs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: neither start nor drop it yet. Spend 1–2 weeks checking the evidence you already have, then decide against a threshold you agree in advance.**\n\n**Why not commit now:** three requests and one loss in a single month is a real signal, but a thin one. It could be a new trend, such as a move upmarket or buyers tightening procurement, or it could be noise. £60k and six months is too much to spend on a hunch when the data to test it is already in your CRM.\n\n**Why not drop it:** enterprise buyers increasingly treat SOC 2 as a hard requirement, and an HR tool holds sensitive employee data. If the signal is real, every month you wait adds six months to when you can close those deals.\n\n**What to do now:**\n1. **Review the 140 lost deals.** Tag each one for security, compliance or procurement issues, including vague reasons like \"went with a bigger vendor\" or \"stalled in procurement.\" Add up the lost revenue.\n2. **Check the open pipeline.** How many current deals are enterprise-sized, and how many have a security review coming?\n3. **Ask sales** whether buyers want SOC 2 specifically. UK/EU buyers may accept ISO 27001 instead.\n\n**Decision rule (set it before you look):** if security-related losses plus at-risk pipeline clearly exceed about £60k plus the effort, ideally by 3x or more, and enterprise is where you're heading, start now. A readiness assessment and a Type I report can come in sooner than six months. If not, park SOC 2 and look again in six months.\n\n**Cheap steps either way:** write a standard security questionnaire response pack and put up a security/trust page. These cost little and help win deals in the meantime."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3188,"cache_read_input_tokens":5036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3188},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f40d0413-74bb-4b1b-995f-a1a44bceda5a","uuid":"3955929b-b2c0-45ac-8b53-d78b34db2318","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:08:33.765Z","request_id":"req_011CfvaffCPj1SvGndtnh3wf"}
